initial_prompt:
I have a few questions about the paper for this repo: https://github.com/DD-DuDa/BitDistiller
What is the name (acronym) of the novel objective they propose?  What is the name of the strongest baseline in the paper's main experiments (other than the proposed method itself), and which Llama model sizes (in billions) were evaluated in the paper that proposed that baseline?
Answer as JSON, e.g. {"objective_name": "ABCD", "baseline_name": "BaselineName", "baseline_model_sizes": [1, 7]}
